# Copy your own legally-obtained Dune (1992) install into this directory.
#
# The build pipeline (utils/build_translation.py) expects a full original
# install -- DUNEPRG.EXE and every original .HSQ file this pipeline
# touches: COMMAND1, DUNECHAR, PHRASE11, PHRASE12, INTDS, GENERIC, FINAL
# (or their .BAK equivalents).
#
# See README.md for setup instructions. This file only exists to keep
# game/ present in a fresh checkout -- everything else you place here is
# intentionally untracked (see .gitignore).
